{"id":"611258","name":"蔬菜肉饼三明治","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/611258/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"80g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"油菜","amount":"10g"},{"name":"全麦土司","amount":"2片"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"2片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜切丝冷水下锅。","img":"images/611258/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切油菜叶。","img":"images/611258/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把胡萝卜煮开。","img":"images/611258/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放油菜。","img":"images/611258/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"过冷水，撰干水分切成末。","img":"images/611258/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取肉糜，放食用油、生抽、食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/611258/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀放菜末。","img":"images/611258/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀放小许清水。","img":"images/611258/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放淀粉。","img":"images/611258/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌至上劲。","img":"images/611258/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把土司放平底锅里煎至金黄。","img":"images/611258/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取出来。","img":"images/611258/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"切番茄片。","img":"images/611258/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"煎个鸡蛋。","img":"images/611258/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/611258/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"油热放入蔬菜肉糜，摊成肉饼。","img":"images/611258/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放平底锅里煎出油脂，弄成土司大小。","img":"images/611258/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"土司上抹沙拉酱。","img":"images/611258/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放肉饼。","img":"images/611258/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"抹沙拉酱。","img":"images/611258/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"放番茄和鸡蛋，抹沙拉酱放番茄和土司。","img":"images/611258/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"包起来，切开。","img":"images/611258/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/611258/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}